    "artist": "NASA Earth Observatory",
    "description": "View of the crescent moon through the top of the Earth's atmosphere. Photographed above 21.5°N, 113.3°E by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Space_Station\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:International Space Station\">International Space Station</a> crew <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Expedition_13\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Expedition 13\">Expedition 13</a> over the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_China_Sea\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:South China Sea\">South China Sea</a>, just south of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macau\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Macau\">Macau</a> (NASA image ID: ISS013-E-54329)."
